<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>By revelation I perceive</l><l>The power that raised Christ from the dead;</l><l>When I by faith this power receive,</l><l>I to the church am led.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thy mighty power has set me free</l><l>From all the world’s distracting things;</l><l>An entrance to the local church</l><l>This mighty power brings.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Once in the local church, I need</l><l>To take Thee as my person, Lord;</l><l>My outward man each day recede,</l><l>My heart is for the Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>I take Thee as my person, Lord;</l><l>I have been crucified with Thee.</l><l>My inner man has been restored;</l><l>I’m now indwelt by Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>When all Thy members self forsake,</l><l>Thy glorious Body, Lord, is known;</l><l>When of Thy Person we partake,</l><l>The one new man is shown.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
